#: scripts/scenario_62_chaos_of_war.lua:4581
msgctxt "msgGM"
msgid ""
"Player teams is the number of player teams. Player ships and player ship "
"types are explained after you click those buttons.\n"
"\n"
"The button 'Random PShip Names' switches from a fixed list of player ship "
"names to selecting player ship names at random from a pool of player ship "
"names. There is no going back to the fixed player ship names once you click "
"this button unless you restart the server."
msgstr "Player teams is the number of player teams. Player ships and player ship types are explained after you click those buttons.\n\nThe button 'Random PShip Names' switches from a fixed list of player ship names to selecting player ship names at random from a pool of player ship names. There is no going back to the fixed player ship names once you click this button unless you restart the server."

